From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mikael Rousson <85865+mmmikael@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 09:17:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] foyelle: surface.list gives each card its description
 and service

The canvas's card gallery explains every card in a line and says which
online service it belongs to. Both come from what the helper already
declares: the resource's description, and _meta.foyelle.service, which
Foyelle's bridge helpers set on the cards of the service they reach.
surface.list now passes them through (description defaults to "", service
to null), and the generated contract is regenerated.

Signed-off-by: Mikael Rousson <85865+mmmikael@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 apps/shared/src/gateway-contract.generated.ts |  2 ++
 apps/shared/src/gateway-contract.openrpc.json | 17 ++++++++++++++++
 tests/tools/test_mcp_surfaces.py              | 20 +++++++++++++++++++
 tools/mcp_surfaces.py                         |  8 +++++++-
 tui_gateway/contracts/surfaces.py             |  2 ++
 5 files changed, 48 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

